        "waitingForApproval_msg": "Atvainojiet, jums pa\u0161laik nav \u013Cauts s\u016Bt\u012Bt vai sa\u0146emt e-pastus, jo j\u016Bsu konts tika iez\u012Bm\u0113ts apstiprin\u0101\u0161anai. \u0160is process ir nepiecie\u0161ams, lai pied\u0101v\u0101tu priv\u0101tumam draudz\u012Bgu re\u0123istr\u0101ciju, vienlaikus nepie\u013Caujot masveida re\u0123istr\u0101ciju. Konts parasti tiks autom\u0101tiski apstiprin\u0101ts p\u0113c 48 stund\u0101m. Pateicamies par paciet\u012Bbu!",
