        "view_label": "Zobrazenie",
        "waitingForApproval_msg": "Je n\xE1m \u013E\xFAto, ale moment\xE1lne nem\xF4\u017Ee\u0161 odosiela\u0165 ani prij\xEDma\u0165 e-maily, preto\u017Ee tvoj \xFA\u010Det bol ozna\u010Den\xFD na schv\xE1lenie. Tento proces je nevyhnutn\xFD pre ponuku registr\xE1cie re\u0161pektuj\xFAcej ochranu s\xFAkromia a s\xFA\u010Dasn\xE9 zabr\xE1nenie hromadn\xFDch registr\xE1ci\xED. \xDA\u010Dty s\xFA zvy\u010Dajne automaticky schv\xE1len\xE9 po 48 hodin\xE1ch. V\u010Faka za trpezlivos\u0165!",
