        "defaultDownloadPath_label": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EABn t\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh",
        "defaultEmailSignature_msg": "--\n<br>\nG\u1EEDi b\u1EB1ng Tutanota, t\u1EADn h\u01B0\u1EDFng th\u01B0 an to\xE0n & kh\xF4ng qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o.\n<br>",
