        "defaultGiftCardMessage_msg": "Mong l\xE0 b\u1EA1n th\xEDch s\u1EF1 an to\xE0n v\xE0 ri\xEAng t\u01B0 m\xE0 b\u1EA1n c\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u1EDBi Tutanota!",
        "defaultMailHandler_label": "Tr\xECnh x\u1EED l\xED th\u01B0 m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh",
        "defaultMailHandler_msg": "\u0110\u0103ng k\xED Tutanota M\xE1y t\xEDnh th\xE0nh tr\xECnh x\u1EED l\xED th\u01B0 m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh, vd. \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\xE1c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 th\u01B0. Thao t\xE1c n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c qu\u1EA3n tr\u1ECB vi\xEAn cho ph\xE9p.",
        "defaultSenderMailAddressInfo_msg": "\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 th\u01B0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi g\u1EEDi m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh cho c\xE1c th\u01B0 m\u1EDBi.",
        "defaultSenderMailAddress_label": "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi g\u1EEDi m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh",
        "defaultShareGiftCardBody_msg": "Ch\xE0o,\n\nT\xF4i \u0111\xE3 mua cho b\u1EA1n m\u1ED9t th\u1EBB qu\xE0 t\u1EB7ng \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng Tutanota, d\xF9ng li\xEAn k\u1EBFt n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y nh\xE9!\n\n{link}\n\nN\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a c\xF3 danh kho\u1EA3n, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng li\xEAn k\u1EBFt \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u0103ng k\xED v\xE0 gi\xE0nh l\u1EA1i s\u1EF1 ri\xEAng t\u01B0 c\u1EE7a m\xECnh.\n\nCh\xFAc ngh\u1EC9 l\u1EC5 vui v\u1EBB,\n{username}",
