        "freeAccountInfo_msg": "M\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF3 m\u1ED9t danh kho\u1EA3n Free. C\xE1c danh kho\u1EA3n Free ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng cho li\xEAn l\u1EA1c c\xE1 nh\xE2n. N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n d\xF9ng Tutanota cho doanh nghi\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c l\xE0m ngh\u1EC1 t\u1EF1 do, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EB7t mua m\u1ED9t thu\xEA bao t\xEDnh ph\xED. Vui l\xF2ng l\u01B0u \xFD th\xEAm r\u1EB1ng c\xE1c danh kho\u1EA3n Free s\u1EBD b\u1ECB xo\xE1 n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp trong s\xE1u th\xE1ng.",
