        "invitationMailBody_msg": "Xin ch\xE0o!<br><br>\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 th\u01B0 m\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a t\xF4i. Tutanota cung c\u1EA5p h\u1ED9p th\u01B0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EADt m\xE3 ho\xE1 to\xE0n di\u1EC7n, kh\xF4ng qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 quy\u1EC1n ri\xEAng t\u01B0 c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta. V\u1EDBi t\xEDnh n\u0103ng m\u1EADt m\xE3 ho\xE1 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng ch\xFAng ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 trao \u0111\u1ED5i th\u01B0 an to\xE0n nh\u01B0 l\xE0 g\u1EEDi th\u01B0 c\xF3 ni\xEAm phong. Cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng th\xEC d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta c\u0169ng \u0111\xE3 thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 ri\xEAng ch\xFAng ta, kh\xF4ng ai kh\xE1c c\xF3 th\u1EC3 truy c\u1EADp.<br><br>Tham gia Tutanota ngay b\xE2y gi\u1EDD:<br>{registrationLink}<br><br><br>Th\xE2n g\u1EEDi,<br>{username}<br><br>T\xE1i b\xFAt: Tutanota mi\u1EC5n ph\xED \u0111i k\xE8m v\u1EDBi 1 GB l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF mi\u1EC5n ph\xED. H\u01A1n n\u1EEFa, Tutanota c\xF2n c\xF3 m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF: {githubLink}",
        "invitationMailSubject_msg": "\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 th\u01B0 m\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a t\xF4i - gia nh\u1EADp Tutanota \u0111\u1EC3 gi\xE0nh l\u1EA1i s\u1EF1 ri\xEAng t\u01B0 c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta",
        "invitation_label": "L\u1EDDi m\u1EDDi",
        "invitedToEvent_msg": "B\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EDDi tham gia s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n n\xE0y. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n d\u1EF1 kh\xF4ng?",
