        "invoiceAddressInfoPrivate_msg": "Th\xF4ng tin n\xE0y kh\xF4ng b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng c\xE1 nh\xE2n (t\u1ED1i \u0111a 5 d\xF2ng).",
