        "other_label": "Kh\xE1c",
        "outdatedClientWarningMailBody_msg": "Xin ch\xE0o,<br>\nb\u1EA1n hi\u1EC7n \u0111ang d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n Tutanota \u0111\xE3 l\u1ED7i th\u1EDDi. H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 cho phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD k\u1EBFt th\xFAc trong v\xE0i ng\xE0y t\u1EDBi.<br><br>\n\nVui l\xF2ng c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt t\u1EA1i: {downloadLink}<br><br>\n\nVui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m tra th\xEAm xem b\u1EA1n c\xF3 \u0111ang d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n Tutanota l\u1ED7i th\u1EDDi tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xE1c hay kh\xF4ng. H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD ng\u1EEBng g\u1EEDi th\u01B0 n\xE0y khi t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c tr\xECnh kh\xE1ch Tutanota c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt.<br><br>\n\nXin c\u1EA3m \u01A1n!<br><br>\n\n\u0110\u1ED9i ng\u0169 Tutanota",
        "outdatedClientWarningMailSubject_msg": "Vui l\xF2ng c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt Tutanota",
        "outdatedClient_msg": "Vui l\xF2ng c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt Tutanota. Phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n \u0111ang c\xE0i qu\xE1 c\u0169 v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3.",
        "outlookInvoiceMailBodyAutomatic_msg": "c\xF3 m\u1ED9t ho\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n m\u1EDBi cho b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1 {1} \u0111\xEDnh k\xE8m theo th\u01B0 n\xE0y. T\u1ED5ng chi ph\xED s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi n\u1EE3. B\u1EA1n c\u0169ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 xem t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c ho\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh \u1EDF {2}",
        "outlookInvoiceMailBodyOnAccount_msg": "c\xF3 m\u1ED9t ho\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n m\u1EDBi cho b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1 {1} \u0111\xEDnh k\xE8m theo th\u01B0 n\xE0y. H\u1EA1n thanh to\xE1n l\xE0 7 ng\xE0y sau ng\xE0y ghi tr\xEAn ho\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n. B\u1EA1n c\u0169ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 xem t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c ho\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh \u1EDF {2}.",
