        "subscriptionPeriodInfoPrivate_msg": "K\xEC thu\xEA bao l\xE0 m\u1ED9t th\xE1ng khi tr\u1EA3 ph\xED h\u1EB1ng th\xE1ng v\xE0 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t n\u0103m khi tr\u1EA3 ph\xED h\u1EB1ng n\u0103m. Sau giai \u0111o\u1EA1n ban \u0111\u1EA7u, thu\xEA bao s\u1EBD chuy\u1EC3n th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EDDi h\u1EA1n v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hu\u1EF7 b\u1ECF b\u1EA5t k\xEC l\xFAc n\xE0o.",
