        "userUsageDataOptInStatement1_msg": "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng thu th\u1EADp b\u1EA5t k\xEC th\xF4ng tin n\xE0o m\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECBnh danh c\xE1 nh\xE2n",
        "userUsageDataOptInStatement2_msg": "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng chia s\u1EBB d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi b\u1EA5t k\xEC ai",
        "userUsageDataOptInStatement3_msg": "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng cho m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u",
        "userUsageDataOptInStatement4_msg": "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EAFt t\xEDnh n\u0103ng n\xE0y b\u1EA5t k\xEC l\xFAc n\xE0o trong thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp",
        "userUsageDataOptInThankYouOptedIn_msg": "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EA5p thu\u1EADn v\xE0 g\u1EEDi d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n cho ch\xFAng t\xF4i. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EAFt ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng n\xE0y b\u1EA5t k\xEC l\xFAc n\xE0o trong thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp.",
        "userUsageDataOptInThankYouOptedOut_msg": "\u0110\xE3 l\u01B0u l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng g\u1EEDi d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng cho ch\xFAng t\xF4i. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn l\u1EA1i th\xE0nh g\u1EEDi b\u1EA5t k\xEC l\xFAc n\xE0o trong thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED5i \xFD.",
