        "validGiftCardCountry_msg": "Th\u1EBB qu\xE0 t\u1EB7ng n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u1EDF {valid} nh\u01B0ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i th\u1EA5y r\u1EB1ng b\u1EA1n \u0111ang \u1EDF {actual}. Vui l\xF2ng x\xE1c nh\u1EADn r\u1EB1ng b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng th\u1EBB qu\xE0 t\u1EB7ng n\xE0y \u1EDF {valid}.",
