        "viewToday_action": "Xem k\xEC hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i",
        "view_label": "Xem",
        "waitingForApproval_msg": "R\u1EA5t ti\u1EBFc, hi\u1EC7n b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p g\u1EEDi hay nh\u1EADn th\u01B0 v\xEC danh kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EDD x\xE1c nh\u1EADn. Qu\xE1 tr\xECnh n\xE0y l\xE0 c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 cung c\u1EA5p m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 \u0111\u0103ng k\xED t\xF4n tr\u1ECDng t\xEDnh ri\xEAng t\u01B0 v\xE0 ph\xF2ng tr\xE1nh \u0111\u0103ng k\xED v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u1EDBn \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi. Danh kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n th\u01B0\u1EDDng s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng x\xE1c nh\u1EADn sau 48 gi\u1EDD. C\u1EA3m \u01A1n s\u1EF1 nh\u1EABn n\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n!",
        "waitingForU2f_msg": "\u0110ang \u0111\u1EE3i kho\xE1 an ninh...",
        "wantToSendReport_msg": "C\xF3 l\u1ED7i b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD x\u1EA3y ra. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n g\u1EEDi m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n b\xE1o l\u1ED7i kh\xF4ng? B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\xEAm l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFn \u0111\u1EC3 gi\xFAp ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EEDa l\u1ED7i.",
        "weekNumber_label": "Tu\u1EA7n {week}",
        "weekStart_label": "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u tu\u1EA7n v\xE0o",
        "weeks_label": "tu\u1EA7n",
        "week_label": "Tu\u1EA7n",
        "welcomeMailBodyTweetText_msg": "T\xF4i v\u1EEBa m\u1EDBi c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t h\u1ED9p th\u01B0 Tutanota. B\xE2y gi\u1EDD t\xF4i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 th\u01B0 \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EED kh\u1ECFi nh\u1EEFng con m\u1EAFt t\u1ECDc m\u1EA1ch! B\u1EA1n c\u0169ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tham gia:",
        "welcomeMailBody_markdown": "Ch\xE0o m\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1EDBi h\u1ED9p th\u01B0 Tutanota an to\xE0n v\xE0 kh\xF4ng qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 b\u1EB1ng l\u1EDBp m\u1EADt m\xE3 h\xF3a m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD. Tutanota gi\xFAp vi\u1EC7c chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED5i t\u1EEB c\xE1c d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 th\u01B0 kh\xE1c tr\u1EDF n\xEAn d\u1EC5 d\xE0ng. Tr\xECnh kh\xE1ch web, \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng d\xE0nh cho Android & iOS, c\u0169ng nh\u01B0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng m\xE1y t\xEDnh d\xE0nh cho Windows, Mac OS v\xE0 Linux \u0111\u1EC1u tr\u1EF1c quan, cho ph\xE9p b\u1EA1n truy c\u1EADp h\u1ED9p th\u01B0 an to\xE0n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn b\u1EA5t k\xEC thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0o.\n\nL\xE0 m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi chuy\xEAn nghi\u1EC7p, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFt ki\u1EC7m th\u1EDDi gian v\xE0 ti\u1EC1n b\u1EA1c b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF m\u1EADt m\xE3 ho\xE1 n\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 th\u01B0 c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 b\u1EA3o m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a Tutanota \u0111\u1EB7t t\u1EA1i \u0110\u1EE9c: Tutanota Nh\xE3n tr\u1EAFng cho c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c, \u0111\u1EB7t trang \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp \u1EDF \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m web c\u1EE7a ch\xEDnh b\u1EA1n, v\xE0 th\xEAm m\u1ED9t bi\u1EC3u m\u1EABu li\xEAn h\u1EC7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EADt m\xE3 ho\xE1 v\xE0o \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m web \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\u1EC5 d\xE0ng li\xEAn l\u1EA1c v\u1EDBi b\u1EA1n m\u1ED9t c\xE1ch b\u1EA3o m\u1EADt. [T\xECm hi\u1EC3u th\xEAm v\u1EC1 c\xE1c t\xEDnh n\u0103ng c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c to\xE0n di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a Tutanota]({businessLink}).\n\n**Tutanota tu\xE2n theo 4 nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EC3 cung c\u1EA5p m\u1ED9t d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 kh\xE1c bi\u1EC7t t\xF4n tr\u1ECDng s\u1EF1 ri\xEAng t\u01B0**\n\n1. Tutanota kh\xF4ng theo d\xF5i b\u1EA1n.\n2. Tutanota kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 qu\xE9t d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.\n3. Tutanota m\u1EADt m\xE3 h\xF3a to\xE0n b\u1ED9 h\u1ED9p th\u01B0, danh b\u1EA1 v\xE0 l\u1ECBch c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.\n4. Tutanota t\xEDch h\u1EE3p t\xEDnh ri\xEAng t\u01B0 trong thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF.\n\nGi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u Tutanota, [d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 th\u01B0 ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF t\xF4n tr\u1ECDng b\u1EA1n v\xE0 quy\u1EC1n ri\xEAng t\u01B0 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n]({blogOpenSourceLink}).\n\nCh\xFAng t\xF4i tin r\u1EB1ng t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi x\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE1ng c\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t h\u1ED9p th\u01B0 mi\u1EC5n ph\xED v\xE0 ri\xEAng t\u01B0. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u1EE7ng h\u1ED9 ch\xFAng t\xF4i b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch theo d\xF5i ch\xFAng t\xF4i tr\xEAn m\u1EA1ng x\xE3 h\u1ED9i y\xEAu th\xEDch c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\xE0 chia s\u1EBB n\u1ED9i dung c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EDBi b\u1EA1n b\xE8 v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED3ng nghi\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. C\xF9ng nhau, ch\xFAng ta s\u1EBD thay \u0111\u1ED5i Li\xEAn M\u1EA1ng cho t\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EB9p h\u01A1n:\n\n* [LinkedIn]({linkedinLink})\n* [Facebook]({facebookLink})\n* [Mastodon]({mastodonLink})\n* [Twitter]({twitterLink})\n* [Reddit]({redditLink})\n* [Instagram]({instagramLink})\n\nC\u1EA3m \u01A1n r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u,\\\n\u0111\u1ED9i ng\u0169 Tutanota\n\nTutanota c\xF3 m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF. [B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\xE0 so\xE1t v\xE0 x\xE9t duy\u1EC7t m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y]({githubLink}).\n",
        "welcomeMailSubject_msg": "An to\xE0n, xanh & kh\xF4ng qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o!",
