        "whitelabelThemeDetected_msg": "\u0110\xE3 th\u1EA5y c\xF3 m\u1ED9t ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC1 ri\xEAng cho danh kho\u1EA3n n\xE0y. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n \xE1p d\u1EE5ng n\xF3 ngay kh\xF4ng?",
        "whitelabel_label": "Nh\xE3n tr\u1EAFng",
